The EPUB reader menu's icon tab-bar layout (see
src/activities/reader/EpubReaderMenuActivity.h/.cpp: drawIconTabBar/tabSlotRect) is adapted from
CrossInk (https://github.com/uxjulia/CrossInk), also a fork of CrossPoint, licensed under the MIT
License. Navigation is CrossFade's own existing tab+list button scheme (see SettingsActivity).

The Lyra Carousel home theme (src/components/themes/lyra/LyraCarouselTheme.h/.cpp) is a functional
port of CrossInk's Lyra Carousel theme (https://github.com/uxjulia/CrossInk), also a fork of
CrossPoint, licensed under the MIT License. Adapted rather than copied wholesale -- see that file's
own header comment for what differs (no frame-cache pre-rendering, no reading-stats text) and why.

GfxRenderer::drawPerspectiveBitmap (lib/GfxRenderer/GfxRenderer.h/.cpp), the trapezoid-warped
bitmap primitive behind Lyra Carousel's receding side covers, and the side-cover proportions that
use it, are ported from CrossInk's own GfxRenderer and LyraCarouselTheme
(https://github.com/uxjulia/CrossInk), also a fork of CrossPoint, licensed under the MIT License --
adapted to this fork's own row-buffer allocation pattern (malloc/free per call, matching this
file's existing drawBitmap, rather than CrossInk's pooled scratch allocator, which this fork
doesn't have); the per-column perspective math itself is unchanged.

CrossFade modifications are likewise released under the MIT License.
